 "intro_zh": "秦淮河全长五公里，史称“十里秦淮”，是夫子庙-秦淮风光带精华所在。夫子庙-秦淮风光带是集自然风光、山水园林、庙宇学堂、街市民居、乡土人情为一体的旅游区。",
 "intro_en": "The Qinhuai River is five kilometers long and is known as the \"Ten Miles of Qinhuai\" in history. It is the essence of the Confucius Temple-Qinhuai Scenic Area. Confucius Temple-Qinhuai Scenic Belt is a tourist area integrating natural scenery, landscape gardens, temples and schools, residents and local people.",
